{"content":[{"c":[{"c":["PERAZIM, Mount"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"}],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Mountain mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.28.21","r":"Isa.28.21","rawR":"Isa.28.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.28.21","value":"Isa.28.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isaiah 28:21"},", apparently near Baal-perazim, the “Baal of Breaches,” where David defeated the Philistines. From the context of ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.5.20","r":"2Sam.5.20","rawR":"2Sam.5.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.5.20","value":"2Sam.5.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 5:20"},", this battleground was evidently located in the valley of Rephaim, southwest of Jerusalem."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"PerazimMount","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Isaiah 28:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.28.21","rawQueryValue":"Isa.28.21","sourceRefExact":"Isa.28.21"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 5:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.5.20","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.5.20","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.5.20"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"47343b25f78bc6ebb84cf168e613e2ec4bc700d81315132025e20e483581952b","sourceItemName":"PerazimMount","sourceItemOrder":114,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"PerazimMount","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Perazim, Mount","title":"Perazim, Mount","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}